WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Start from a keyword. Someone messages the word you have chosen.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
Ask for an email. Explain why you need it. SKIP and STOP stay available.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Save the reply. A valid email becomes a lead, not a marketing subscription.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
Deliver the resource. Connect both the email and skip paths to your link.
